Supalite contributions

This is an independent contribution workspace for Supabase Lite.

The development harness uses the published @supabase/lite 0.11.0 package,
licensed under Apache-2.0. Generated baseline and patched package copies retain
that package's LICENSE. Its published package integrity and the modified bundle
checksum are verified by scripts/prepare-baseline.mjs.

The feature modules in src/ are original TypeScript. This workspace is not a
recovery of the unpublished upstream TypeScript repository.
